{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-69946" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate the area of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}].$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/state.json" "file_sha256" "d3b559504d90ede1ca351b50c27b65bbec0362a4703263e59c933ddcde45e5d5"} {"question" "q-69946" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & \\frac{1}{4} \\\\ 4 & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}-2 & \\frac{1}{4} \\\\ 4 & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-2)\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2})-\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot 4 \\\\  & =1-1 \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,0\\,|=0\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/state.json" "file_sha256" "d3b559504d90ede1ca351b50c27b65bbec0362a4703263e59c933ddcde45e5d5"} {"question" "q-69946" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "e0d2b8203f602925d5c9e95d8816b7054e330e64b8609d000fecb50d032ce8f1"} {"question" "q-69946" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/state.json" "file_sha256" "d3b559504d90ede1ca351b50c27b65bbec0362a4703263e59c933ddcde45e5d5"} {"question" "q-69946" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "0"] ["math" "1"] ["math" "2"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2}"] ["math" "\\sqrt{7}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/state.json" "file_sha256" "d3b559504d90ede1ca351b50c27b65bbec0362a4703263e59c933ddcde45e5d5"} {"question" "q-69946" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "0"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/state.json" "file_sha256" "d3b559504d90ede1ca351b50c27b65bbec0362a4703263e59c933ddcde45e5d5"} {"question" "q-102757" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate the area of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=⟨3,2⟩$ and $\\text{v}=⟨-6,-4⟩.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/state.json" "file_sha256" "d3b559504d90ede1ca351b50c27b65bbec0362a4703263e59c933ddcde45e5d5"} {"question" "q-102757" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -6 \\\\ 2 & -4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & -6 \\\\ 2 & -4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot (-4)-(-6)\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =-12+12 \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,0\\,|=0\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/state.json" "file_sha256" "d3b559504d90ede1ca351b50c27b65bbec0362a4703263e59c933ddcde45e5d5"} {"question" "q-102757" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "e0d2b8203f602925d5c9e95d8816b7054e330e64b8609d000fecb50d032ce8f1"} {"question" "q-102757" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/state.json" "file_sha256" "d3b559504d90ede1ca351b50c27b65bbec0362a4703263e59c933ddcde45e5d5"} {"question" "q-102757" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "0"] ["math" "12"] ["math" "18"] ["math" "24"] ["math" "6"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/state.json" "file_sha256" "d3b559504d90ede1ca351b50c27b65bbec0362a4703263e59c933ddcde45e5d5"} {"question" "q-102757" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "0"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/state.json" "file_sha256" "d3b559504d90ede1ca351b50c27b65bbec0362a4703263e59c933ddcde45e5d5"} {"question" "q-275539" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Determine the area $A$ of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}].$\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/state.json" "file_sha256" "d3b559504d90ede1ca351b50c27b65bbec0362a4703263e59c933ddcde45e5d5"} {"question" "q-275539" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1\\cdot (-1)-4\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =-9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,-9\\,|=9\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/state.json" "file_sha256" "d3b559504d90ede1ca351b50c27b65bbec0362a4703263e59c933ddcde45e5d5"} {"question" "q-275539" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "e0d2b8203f602925d5c9e95d8816b7054e330e64b8609d000fecb50d032ce8f1"} {"question" "q-275539" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/state.json" "file_sha256" "d3b559504d90ede1ca351b50c27b65bbec0362a4703263e59c933ddcde45e5d5"} {"question" "q-275539" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "9"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/state.json" "file_sha256" "d3b559504d90ede1ca351b50c27b65bbec0362a4703263e59c933ddcde45e5d5"} {"question" "q-320413" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Determine the area $A$ of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=⟨-4,-1⟩$ and $\\text{v}=⟨6,2⟩.$\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/state.json" "file_sha256" "d3b559504d90ede1ca351b50c27b65bbec0362a4703263e59c933ddcde45e5d5"} {"question" "q-320413" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 6 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}-4 & 6 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-4)\\cdot 2-6\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =-8-(-6) \\\\  & =-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,-2\\,|=2\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/state.json" "file_sha256" "d3b559504d90ede1ca351b50c27b65bbec0362a4703263e59c933ddcde45e5d5"} {"question" "q-320413" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "e0d2b8203f602925d5c9e95d8816b7054e330e64b8609d000fecb50d032ce8f1"} {"question" "q-320413" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/state.json" "file_sha256" "d3b559504d90ede1ca351b50c27b65bbec0362a4703263e59c933ddcde45e5d5"} {"question" "q-320413" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "2"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/state.json" "file_sha256" "d3b559504d90ede1ca351b50c27b65bbec0362a4703263e59c933ddcde45e5d5"} {"question" "q-320558" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Given that the area spanned between the vectors $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}-\\sqrt{7} \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}a \\\\ -10\\end{aligned}]$ equals zero, what is the value of $a?$\n\n$a=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/state.json" "file_sha256" "d3b559504d90ede1ca351b50c27b65bbec0362a4703263e59c933ddcde45e5d5"} {"question" "q-320558" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}-\\sqrt{7} & a \\\\ 5 & -10\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}-\\sqrt{7} & a \\\\ 5 & -10\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-\\sqrt{7})(-10)-a\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =10\\sqrt{7}-5a\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, setting the expression for the determinant equal to $0$ and solving for $a,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}10\\sqrt{7}-5a & =0 \\\\ 5a & =10\\sqrt{7} \\\\ a & =2\\sqrt{7}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/state.json" "file_sha256" "d3b559504d90ede1ca351b50c27b65bbec0362a4703263e59c933ddcde45e5d5"} {"question" "q-320558" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "e0d2b8203f602925d5c9e95d8816b7054e330e64b8609d000fecb50d032ce8f1"} {"question" "q-320558" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/state.json" "file_sha256" "d3b559504d90ede1ca351b50c27b65bbec0362a4703263e59c933ddcde45e5d5"} {"question" "q-320558" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "2\\sqrt{7}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14008824/state.json" "file_sha256" "d3b559504d90ede1ca351b50c27b65bbec0362a4703263e59c933ddcde45e5d5"}] "usage" {} "basis" 1141 "retractions" [] "immutable_answers" [] "immutable_fields" [] "no_history" []}
